      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a valid concern that high test scores sometimes indicate strong pattern recognition rather than deep, novel problem-solving capability. To address this, I suggest you look for evidence of *how* she solved the complex problems, not just the correct final answer. Ask follow-up, \"why\" or \"how might you change this for X condition\" questions to probe for that required architectural intuition. This more targeted approach will reveal if her knowledge is superficially applied or deeply understood.",
